          "snippet": {
            "line": 82,
            "text": "theorem rescale_residual (μ a : ℝ) (ha : a ≠ 0) (u : VelocityField)\n    (p : PressureField) (t : ℝ) (x : Space) :\n    ProblemStatement.navierStokesResidual (a ^ 2 * μ)\n      (rescale a a⁻¹ u) (rescale (a ^ 2) a⁻¹ p) t x =\n      a • ProblemStatement.navierStokesResidual μ u p t (a⁻¹ • x)"
          }
